    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522-a1">

                <pb facs="0641" n="573" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg573"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Savage to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consulate of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Havana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1867-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 19, 1867.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Maximilian’s remains surrendered. Coming here. Elvin and Salm Salm here pardoned.
                    Baron Magnus here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS SAVAGE, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Consul
                        General</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
